{"seq":1,"slug":"cwnd-reno-cubic","title":"拥塞窗口、Reno/CUBIC 与丢包反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/tcp-http-network-performance/congestion-control/cwnd-reno-cubic","wordCount":2415,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"拥塞窗口-reno-cubic-与丢包反馈\">拥塞窗口、Reno/CUBIC 与丢包反馈</h1><p>一条 1Gbps、RTT 40ms 的链路，理论在途数据量是 5MB（即 BDP，Bandwidth-Delay Product）。发送端如果在第一个 RTT 里只发 64KB，链路就有 98% 是空的。TCP 的慢启动就是为了在有限信息下快速逼近这个数，而它的刹车信号只有两个：ACK 到达的节奏，和丢包。本篇讲 cwnd 如何在这个刹车信号下演化，以及发送端究竟怎么知道「丢了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-拥塞窗口与三个关键量\">核心概念：拥塞窗口与三个关键量</h2><p>TCP 发送端同时受两个窗口约束：接收窗口 <code>rwnd</code>（接收方通告的剩余缓冲区）和拥塞窗口 <code>cwnd</code>（发送方对网络容量的估计）。实际在途未确认字节数的上限是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\min(cwnd, rwnd)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>吞吐上限近似为窗口除以 RTT：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\approx \\frac{W}{RTT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子解释了一切经验现象。跨洲际链路 RTT 200ms，如果 cwnd 只有 64KB，吞吐上限就是 2.6Mbps——无论带宽多大。要跑满 1Gbps，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>Gbps</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mtext>s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 1\\text{Gbps} \\times 0.2\\text{s} = 25\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gbps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这就是「长肥管道」（LFN，Long Fat Network）问题的全部内容：窗口必须随 BDP 线性增长，而窗口的增长速度受算法限制。</p>\n<p>另一个关键量是 <code>ssthresh</code>（慢启动阈值），它标记慢启动与拥塞避免的分界线。最初 ssthresh 是任意大的，第一次丢包后它被设为当前窗口的一半，此后每次丢包都继续减半。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[连接建立&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = IW 10 MSS] --&gt; B{cwnd &lt; ssthresh?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[慢启动&lt;br/&gt;每 ACK 增 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;指数增长]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[拥塞避免&lt;br/&gt;每 RTT 增约 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]&#10;    C --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; E{检测到丢包}&#10;    E --&gt;|超时| F[ssthresh = cwnd/2&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;回到慢启动]&#10;    E --&gt;|快速重传| G[ssthresh = cwnd/2&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = ssthresh&lt;br/&gt;快速恢复]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[连接建立&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = IW 10 MSS] --&gt; B{cwnd &lt; ssthresh?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[慢启动&lt;br/&gt;每 ACK 增 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;指数增长]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[拥塞避免&lt;br/&gt;每 RTT 增约 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]\n    C --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; E{检测到丢包}\n    E --&gt;|超时| F[ssthresh = cwnd/2&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = 1 MSS&lt;br/&gt;回到慢启动]\n    E --&gt;|快速重传| G[ssthresh = cwnd/2&lt;br/&gt;cwnd = ssthresh&lt;br/&gt;快速恢复]\n    F --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; D</pre><p>初始窗口 IW 从 RFC 2581 的 2 个 MSS 提升到 RFC 6928 的 10 个 MSS（约 14600 字节），这个改动让短连接的首个 RTT 就能传完大部分小响应，对 HTTP 首屏收益极大。RFC 6928 的 10 MSS 到今天仍是 Linux 的默认值，但 2023 年后 IW 的进一步增大（20 或 40 MSS）在高带宽低延迟的内网场景被反复讨论，争议点在于它会加剧与旧算法的公平性问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"慢启动-aimd-与-reno-的窗口演化\">慢启动、AIMD 与 Reno 的窗口演化</h2><p>慢启动的名字有误导性：它的增长是指数的，只是起点低。每收到一个 ACK，cwnd 增加 1 个 MSS；一个 RTT 内所有包都被确认，于是 cwnd 翻倍：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cwnd(t) = IW \\cdot 2^{\\lfloor t / RTT \\rfloor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>到 cwnd 超过 ssthresh，进入拥塞避免，改用 AIMD（加性增、乘性减）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（每 ACK，等价于每 RTT 加 1 MSS）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cwnd \\leftarrow cwnd + \\frac{MSS}{cwnd} \\quad \\text{（每 ACK，等价于每 RTT 加 1 MSS）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（每</span><span class=\"mord\"> ACK</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，等价于每</span><span class=\"mord\"> RTT </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加</span><span class=\"mord\"> 1 MSS</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>丢包时乘性减半。这两个动作合起来的稳态行为是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条共享同一瓶颈的 Reno 流，每条最终收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C \\cdot RTT^2}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级的窗口（C 为常数），因此同一 RTT 的流能公平分享带宽，而 RTT 不同的流分享的比例与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/RTT^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比——RTT 小的流拿到远多于公平份额的带宽。这是 Reno 的第二个结构性缺陷（第一个是丢包才减速）。</p>\n<p>Reno 的窗口轨迹是锯齿形的：线性爬升到丢包，腰斩，再线性爬升。在带宽时延积很大的链路上，这个锯齿的周期太长，爬升过程本身浪费了大量可用带宽。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>增长律</th>\n<th>丢包响应</th>\n<th>主要问题</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tahoe</td>\n<td>指数→线性</td>\n<td>超时/快重传都回慢启动</td>\n<td>恢复太慢</td>\n<td>历史参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reno</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>快重传时减半（快速恢复）</td>\n<td>多丢包时性能骤降、RTT 偏置</td>\n<td>低 BDP 链路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NewReno</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>部分 ACK 逐段恢复</td>\n<td>仍需多个 RTT 恢复</td>\n<td>中低 BDP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUBIC</td>\n<td>三次函数</td>\n<td>减半后凸增长</td>\n<td>对 RTT 不敏感（也是缺点）</td>\n<td>现代 Linux 默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BBR</td>\n<td>模型驱动</td>\n<td>不看丢包</td>\n<td>公平性与队列共存问题</td>\n<td>长肥管道、高丢包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cubic-的三次函数与-tcp-friendliness\">CUBIC 的三次函数与 TCP Friendliness</h2><p>CUBIC 放弃线性爬升，改用定义在<strong>时间</strong>上的三次函数而非 RTT 上的。记上一次丢包后的窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，减半后的窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\beta W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 默认 0.7），时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 从丢包时刻起算，窗口为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(t) = C (t - K)^3 + W_{max}, \\quad K = \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{W_{max}(1-\\beta)}{C}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"root\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9035em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0812em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是把窗口重新推回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 所需的时间，常量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 默认 0.4。函数形状是关键：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0 时曲线是凹的，窗口增长很快，迅速离开丢包后的低谷；接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 时曲线变凸，增长放缓，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近谨慎试探，不会立刻再撞墙。这种「远处加速、近处刹车」的行为让 CUBIC 在高 BDP 链路上的平均窗口远高于 Reno，实测在同样丢包率下吞吐可高一个数量级。</p>\n<p>CUBIC 的另一个设计是 TCP Friendliness 区域：当窗口还很小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 小于阈值，典型是 1.5 时），CUBIC 的行为退化回 Reno 的线性增长。这是为了避免在低 BDP 场景（比如局域网内的小传输）里 CUBIC 比 Reno 更具侵略性，挤占传统流的份额。</p>\n<p>代价是 RTT 公平性。因为 CUBIC 的增长依赖绝对时间而非 RTT，RTT 10ms 的流在 1 秒内经历了 100 轮窗口更新，RTT 200ms 的流只经历 5 轮，两者窗口增长的差异同样显著。CUBIC 并没有真正解决 Reno 的 RTT 偏置，只是换个形式表现出来。想进一步摆脱丢包信号的读者应读 <a href=\"../congestion-control/bbr-bottleneck-bw\">BBR：瓶颈带宽与 RTT 模型</a>。</p>\n<p>现代 Linux 保持 CUBIC 为默认拥塞控制算法（<code>net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=cubic</code>），可选的还有 <code>reno</code>、<code>vegas</code>、<code>dctcp</code>（数据中心 ECN 场景）、<code>bbr</code>（需要 <code>tcp_bbr</code> 模块）。切换算法是全局或按 socket 的，可用 <code>setsockopt(IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_CONGESTION, &quot;bbr&quot;)</code> 对单条连接生效，这对只想给特定大流量连接换算法的场景很实用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"丢包反馈链路-发送端怎么知道丢了\">丢包反馈链路：发送端怎么知道丢了</h2><p>发送端没有「包丢了」这个事件，只有两个替代信号。第一个是<strong>超时</strong>：发出后 RTO 时间没收到对应 ACK，判定丢失并回慢启动。这是最慢的路径，一次超时可能让窗口从几百个 MSS 掉到 1 个。RTO 的计算与边界见 <a href=\"../tcp-tuning/retransmit-rto\">重传、RACK/RTO 与乱序参数</a>。</p>\n<p>第二个是<strong>重复 ACK</strong>。接收方收到乱序包时（比如期望 seq=1000 却来了 2000），会立刻重发最后一个按序 ACK（ACK 1000），这就是一个重复 ACK。发送端收到 3 个重复 ACK 就触发快速重传，那个包很可能只是丢了，后续包已到达，因此不需要回慢启动，而是快速恢复：ssthresh 设为 cwnd/2，cwnd 设为 ssthresh（部分实现是 ssthresh + 3）。</p>\n<p>这套机制有三种误判模式，理解了它们才能读懂抓包结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>抓包特征</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单个包丢失</td>\n<td>后续包触发重复 ACK</td>\n<td>3 个 dup ACK 后立即重传，无超时</td>\n<td>窗口减半，影响小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乱序到达</td>\n<td>接收方误以为丢包</td>\n<td>重复 ACK 后跟正常 ACK</td>\n<td>无谓重传，浪费带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部丢包</td>\n<td>丢失的包后面没有足够后续包</td>\n<td>凑不够 3 个 dup ACK，只能等 RTO</td>\n<td>超时，窗口骤降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>尾部丢包是延迟激增的常见原因：一个窗口里最后一个包丢了，凑不出 3 个重复 ACK，发送端只能干等到 RTO 才重传。RACK（Recent ACKNOWLEDGement）就是为解决这类问题设计的——它用「已确认包的时间戳」而不是「重复 ACK 计数」来判断丢失，只要一个包比已确认的包早了足够长时间没被确认，就判丢，不需要等 3 个 dup ACK。</p>\n<p><strong>SACK</strong>（Selective ACK，RFC 2018）让接收方在 ACK 里报告哪些不连续块已收到，发送端就能精确知道哪些包需要重传，而不是像 NewReno 那样一个 RTT 只补一个洞。SACK 在生产环境几乎总是开启的（<code>net.ipv4.tcp_sack=1</code>），关掉它只在极少数有已知 bug 的中间盒路径上才有必要。<strong>DSACK</strong>（RFC 2883）进一步让接收方报告重复收到的块，发送端据此区分「我的重传是多余的（网络只是乱序）」和「我的重传确实补上了洞」，从而避免无谓的 cwnd 缩减——这是把乱序与丢包分开的关键机制。</p>\n<p>无论哪种信号，最终都归结到一个问题：拥塞信号与真实拥塞的相关性有多强。丢包可能来自带宽饱和的队列溢出，也可能来自链路上的随机误码（无线、长距光缆），后者发生时窗口减半完全没有必要，因为网络中还有大量余量。这是 BBR 那条技术路线的出发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>吞吐上限由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(cwnd, rwnd) / RTT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 决定；长肥管道跑不满的根本原因是窗口增长跟不上 BDP。</li>\n<li>慢启动指数增长到 ssthresh，转拥塞避免线性增长；丢包时 AIMD 乘性减半，形成锯齿。</li>\n<li>Reno 的两大结构性缺陷是「必须丢包才减速」与 RTT 偏置（窗口份额正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/RTT^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>CUBIC 用时间域三次函数替代线性增长，凹段快速爬升、凸段谨慎试探，在高 BDP 下吞吐显著优于 Reno；但 RTT 偏置问题依然存在。</li>\n<li>发送端靠超时与重复 ACK 推断丢包，两者分别对应窗口回慢启动与减半快速恢复；尾部丢包只能等 RTO。</li>\n<li>SACK/DSACK 把乱序与丢包分开，RACK 用时间戳替代重复 ACK 计数，是现代内核正确判断丢包的基础。</li>\n<li>丢包信号在某些链路上与拥塞无关（随机误码），这是模型驱动算法的动机，见 <a href=\"../congestion-control/bbr-bottleneck-bw\">BBR：瓶颈带宽与 RTT 模型</a>；队列本身如何制造延迟则见 <a href=\"../congestion-control/bufferbloat-queuing\">Bufferbloat、排队延迟与 AQM/CoDel</a>。</li>\n<li>调优窗口相关参数（缓冲区、初始窗口）前，先读 <a href=\"../tcp-tuning/kernel-parameters\">核心 sysctl 参数与读写缓冲区自整定</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拥塞窗口、Reno/CUBIC 与丢包反馈","id":"拥塞窗口-reno-cubic-与丢包反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：拥塞窗口与三个关键量","id":"核心概念-拥塞窗口与三个关键量"},{"level":2,"text":"慢启动、AIMD 与 Reno 的窗口演化","id":"慢启动-aimd-与-reno-的窗口演化"},{"level":2,"text":"CUBIC 的三次函数与 TCP Friendliness","id":"cubic-的三次函数与-tcp-friendliness"},{"level":2,"text":"丢包反馈链路：发送端怎么知道丢了","id":"丢包反馈链路-发送端怎么知道丢了"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"BBR：瓶颈带宽与 RTT 模型及部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/tcp-http-network-performance/congestion-control/bbr-bottleneck-bw"}}